# 1code
.1code/

# Claude Code
CLAUDE.md

# Web UI toolchain (the build output under
# src/video_searching_agent/web/static is committed on purpose, so the UI
# works from a clean clone without npm)
ui/node_modules/
ui/.vite/
npm-debug.log*
.vercel

# Eval run records and their scorecards. A run is a measurement of one
# deployment at one moment, and it can be large; eval/sample-scorecard.md is
# committed instead so the output's shape is visible from a clean clone.
eval/results/

# The annotation store is data, not code. Its rows come from runs.
data/

# A test run that cannot write to data/ falls back to the repo root, leaving a
# stray annotation store here. Untracked and unignored, one `git add -A` would
# have committed a database of clip titles.
annotations.sqlite3
